    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pyyq](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pyyq) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 63.628 depth occurred on Mar 15 2025 86km NW of Oaxaca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 17.2818 longitude -97.4712. It impacted 150338 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
